# Architecture

- `forge-domain`: entities and invariants only. No Axum, SQLx, Tokio, HTTP, or SQLite.
- `forge-application`: services, commands, repository traits. Depends only on domain.
- `forge-server`: SQLite repos, migrations, Axum, config, tracing. Composition root.

Dependency direction is server → application → domain. Do not invert it.

SQLite is the source of truth. Do not introduce cloud infrastructure.
